  authorName: Pete van Norman
  publishDate: February 21, 2068
  HeadlineText: There is a really bad smell in the hospital
  detailsText: "Patients at the local hospital are struggling with poor hygiene because there is not enough water available for bathing. Many patients have gone for days without being able to take a proper bath or shower.   The situation is causing an unpleasant smell throughout the hospital. Patients and staff are becoming increasingly frustrated and are asking the hospital management to find a solution.   \u201CBeing in the hospital is already difficult enough. We should at least be able to keep ourselves clean,\u201D one patient said."
